      "name": "Utilisateurs",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Generer des utilisateurs fictifs",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Enregistre le premier utilisateur genere afin de pouvoir",
                  "// tester rapidement l'import (endpoint Importer des utilisateurs).",
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Un tableau JSON est retourne\", function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"lastGeneratedUsersRaw\", pm.response.text());",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/generate?count=10",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "generate"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "count",
                  "value": "10",
                  "description": "Nombre d'utilisateurs a generer (entier entre 1 et 1000, obligatoire)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Genere N utilisateurs fictifs realistes et declenche le telechargement d'un fichier JSON (en-tete Content-Disposition: attachment).\n\nAuthentification requise : Non\n\nParametres de requete (query params) :\n- count (integer, requis) : nombre d'utilisateurs a generer, entre 1 et 1000\n\nFormat de reponse (200) : tableau JSON d'objets utilisateur au format suivant :\n[{\n  \"firstName\": \"string\",\n  \"lastName\": \"string\",\n  \"birthDate\": \"date ISO 8601\",\n  \"city\": \"string\",\n  \"country\": \"code ISO2\",\n  \"avatar\": \"url\",\n  \"company\": \"string\",\n  \"jobPosition\": \"string\",\n  \"mobile\": \"string\",\n  \"username\": \"string\",\n  \"email\": \"string\",\n  \"password\": \"string (6 a 10 caracteres)\",\n  \"role\": \"admin ou user\"\n}]\n\nErreurs possibles :\n- 400 : parametre count manquant, non numerique, negatif, nul ou superieur a 1000"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK - Fichier JSON genere",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/generate?count=2",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "users", "generate"],
                  "query": [{ "key": "count", "value": "2" }]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" },
                { "key": "Content-Disposition", "value": "attachment; filename=\"users-2.json\"" }
              ],
              "body": "[\n  {\n    \"firstName\": \"Awa\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Traore\",\n    \"birthDate\": \"1992-03-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"city\": \"Bouake\",\n    \"country\": \"CI\",\n    \"avatar\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91231?v=4\",\n    \"company\": \"Kone et Fils\",\n    \"jobPosition\": \"Ingenieure logiciel\",\n    \"mobile\": \"+225 07 12 34 56 78\",\n    \"username\": \"awa.traore.k93x\",\n    \"email\": \"awa.traore@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"Xk92mQ1\",\n    \"role\": \"user\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"firstName\": \"Ismael\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Diabate\",\n    \"birthDate\": \"1988-11-02T00:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"city\": \"Yamoussoukro\",\n    \"country\": \"CI\",\n    \"avatar\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44210?v=4\",\n    \"company\": \"Diabate Consulting\",\n    \"jobPosition\": \"Administrateur systeme\",\n    \"mobile\": \"+225 05 98 76 54 32\",\n    \"username\": \"ismael.diabate.p7q2\",\n    \"email\": \"ismael.diabate@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"aT4mZq99\",\n    \"role\": \"admin\"\n  }\n]"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Bad Request - count invalide",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/generate?count=0",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "users", "generate"],
                  "query": [{ "key": "count", "value": "0" }]
                }
              },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Le parametre 'count' doit etre un entier strictement positif\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Importer des utilisateurs (batch)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Le resume contient total, imported, failed\", function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('total');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('imported');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('failed');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/batch",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "batch"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Fichier JSON contenant un tableau d'utilisateurs (meme format que la reponse de l'endpoint Generer des utilisateurs fictifs). Selectionner un fichier .json local, par exemple celui telecharge via la requete precedente."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Importe en base de donnees une liste d'utilisateurs fournie sous forme de fichier JSON.\n\nAuthentification requise : Non\n\nContent-Type : multipart/form-data\n\nParametres (form-data) :\n- file (fichier, requis) : fichier .json contenant un tableau d'objets utilisateur\n\nComportement :\n- chaque enregistrement est valide individuellement (schema RawUser)\n- les doublons sur email ou username (deja en base, ou dupliques dans le fichier) sont rejetes sans bloquer le reste du traitement\n- les mots de passe sont haches (bcrypt) avant stockage, jamais stockes en clair\n\nFormat de reponse (200) :\n{\n  \"total\": number,\n  \"imported\": number,\n  \"failed\": number,\n  \"errors\": [\n    { \"index\": number, \"identifier\": \"string\", \"reason\": \"string\" }\n  ]\n}\n\nErreurs possibles :\n- 400 : aucun fichier fourni, fichier non JSON, ou contenu JSON qui n'est pas un tableau"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK - Import reussi",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/batch",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "users", "batch"]
                },
                "body": {
                  "mode": "formdata",
                  "formdata": [{ "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": [] }]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"total\": 10,\n  \"imported\": 8,\n  \"failed\": 2,\n  \"errors\": [\n    {\n      \"index\": 3,\n      \"identifier\": \"awa.traore@example.com\",\n      \"reason\": \"Email ou username deja existant en base de donnees\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"index\": 7,\n      \"identifier\": \"ismael.diabate@example.com\",\n      \"reason\": \"Doublon au sein du fichier importe (email ou username)\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Bad Request - fichier manquant",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/batch",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "users", "batch"]
                },
                "body": { "mode": "formdata", "formdata": [] }
              },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Aucun fichier fourni. Le champ multipart attendu est 'file'.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Consulter mon profil (me)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Statut 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Le mot de passe n'est jamais retourne\", function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.password).to.be.undefined;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "me"]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "description": "Retourne le profil complet de l'utilisateur associe au token JWT envoye.\n\nAuthentification requise : Oui (Bearer token)\nEn-tete : Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}\n\nFormat de reponse (200) :\n{\n  \"id\": \"string\",\n  \"firstName\": \"string\",\n  \"lastName\": \"string\",\n  \"birthDate\": \"date ISO 8601\",\n  \"city\": \"string\",\n  \"country\": \"string\",\n  \"avatar\": \"url\",\n  \"company\": \"string\",\n  \"jobPosition\": \"string\",\n  \"mobile\": \"string\",\n  \"username\": \"string\",\n  \"email\": \"string\",\n  \"role\": \"admin ou user\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"date ISO 8601\"\n}\n\nErreurs possibles :\n- 401 : en-tete Authorization manquant, mal forme, ou token invalide/expire"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "users", "me"]
                },
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }]
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"3fa1f1c0-1c9a-4e2f-9b21-2a3e0f6a9b12\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Awa\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Traore\",\n  \"birthDate\": \"1992-03-14T00:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"city\": \"Bouake\",\n  \"country\": \"CI\",\n  \"avatar\": \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91231?v=4\",\n  \"company\": \"Kone et Fils\",\n  \"jobPosition\": \"Ingenieure logiciel\",\n  \"mobile\": \"+225 07 12 34 56 78\",\n  \"username\": \"awa.traore.k93x\",\n  \"email\": \"awa.traore@example.com\",\n  \"role\": \"user\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-13T10:15:00.000Z\"\n}"
            },
